sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor M as Member on the website
  participant W as Website reads
  participant L as Leaderboard
  participant A as Album
  M->>W: opens the Leaderboard page (period, team)
  W->>L: boardsOf(viewer, period, team)
  L->>L: one index range: recognition totals by workspace + period
  L->>L: rank people by each count in memory, sum company teams (Q6)
  L->>L: opted-out members skipped (isOnTheBoards)
  L-->>W: people, teams, pinned me, four counts per row
  W-->>M: the boards
  Note over W,L: the player card's placeOf and the link card's all-time boards move here too (Q7)
  M->>W: opens the Album
  W->>A: albumOf(viewer)
  A-->>W: Book, items, hoggies, no board data
